# cavekit-find-on-page.md R5 (T-678): a page loaded while the bar is open closes it (its match cleared, the keyboard
# away): the new page is not searched with the old word.
id: find-navigate
section: Find on page
item: Find on Page open with a word found, then another page loaded: the bar closes, the keyboard goes, the word is not searched on the new page
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-find.html
kit: cavekit-find-on-page.md R5
calibrate top
sample before-menu 0,30,300,180
chrome appmenu
wait differs 0,30,300,180 before-menu 5
wait still 0,30,300,180 3
mark
chrome appmenu-find
expect keyboard up 8
type-keys zebra
wait line 'find .5 bytes. -> 1' 10
wait line 'find-result: {"index":1,"total":6' 10
inject url http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
wait load 15
wait line 'find: cleared' 8
expect keyboard down 8
expect url jihad-card-events
shoot new-page
